{"id":10011,"date":"2025-05-17T08:38:31","date_gmt":"2025-05-17T08:38:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/?page_id=10011"},"modified":"2026-07-13T18:34:18","modified_gmt":"2026-07-13T18:34:18","slug":"isaca","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/isaca\/","title":{"rendered":"ISACA"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong><u>FISAT ISACA STUDENT GROUP (FISAT ISG)<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>ISACA provides a world-class ecosystem of support through industry-leading certifications, continuous skills and performance-based education, research insights, frameworks, standards, tools, policies, local chapters and a global network.<\/p>\n<p>FISAT ISG encourages students to enhance their interpersonal competencies and technical expertise in areas such as Cybersecurity, Artificial Intelligence, IT Strategy and Leadership Risk Management, Privacy and Data Protection etc\u00a0 by actively participating in seminars, webinars\u00a0 and interactive training sessions.<\/p>\n<p>ISACA provides various certification courses in <strong>CISA<\/strong> (Certified Information Systems Auditor), <strong>CISM<\/strong> (Certified Information Security Manager), <strong>CRISC<\/strong> (Certified in Risk and Information Systems Control), <strong>CGEIT<\/strong> (Certified in the Governance of Enterprise IT), <strong>CSX-P<\/strong> (Cybersecurity Practitioner Certification) etc.<\/p>\n<p>FISAT ISG\u00a0 will be supported by the ISACA Cochin Local Chapter.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>OUR MISSION<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>To enhance students&#8217; capabilities and competencies in Information Systems and Digital trust by equipping them with comprehensive knowledge, practical skills, and access to a global professional community, thereby ensuring they are well-prepared to address contemporary challenges and contribute to future innovations.<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>OUR VISION<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>To make the next generation of workforce aware of Digital trust and ethics through latest technologies.<\/p>\n<p><strong>ISACA Cochin Chapter Coordinators<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Mr. John Varghese<\/strong>, President<\/li>\n<li><strong>\u2060Mr. Vinod P<\/strong>, Secretary<\/li>\n<li><strong>\u2060Mr. Deepu Sasikumar<\/strong>, Director- Education Coordinator<\/li>\n<li>\u2060<strong>Ms. Jayasree K<\/strong>, Director, Shelead Tech<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>FISAT ISG COORDINATORS<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Dr. Sujesh P Lal<\/strong> (Associate Professor), Staff-In-Charge<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ms. Hansa J Thattil<\/strong> (Assistant Professor, Senior Grade), Staff-In-Charge<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ms. Remya R<\/strong> (Assistant Professor, Special Grade), Staff-In-Charge<\/li>\n<li><strong>Mr. Adithya Krishna J Nair<\/strong> (S2 CSE), President<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ms. Aqueena Joy<\/strong> (MCA) , Vice-President<\/li>\n<li><strong>Mr. Jeffrin Jayan<\/strong> (S4 CSE) , Secretary<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ms. Abhishek G<\/strong> (S2 CSD) , Treasurer<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>FISAT ISACA STUDENT GROUP (FISAT ISG) ISACA provides a world-class ecosystem of support through industry-leading certifications, continuous skills and performance-based education, research insights, frameworks, standards, tools, policies, local chapters and a global network. FISAT ISG encourages students to enhance their interpersonal competencies and technical expertise in areas such as Cybersecurity, Artificial Intelligence, IT Strategy and [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":179,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-10011","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/10011","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collect